ass='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;!-- \u2026 --&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<strong>Box Model.<\/strong> Content &gt; Padding &gt; Border &gt; Margin.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Size (Width x Height) Specify only Content Dimension<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tThis is not true in Quirks mode + prior versions of IE than 6.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h4>This can be overridden by - box-sizing<\/h4>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>border-box &amp; Gecko Specific \"-moz-box-sizing\"<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<h2>In order to let old browsers bypass JS<\/h2>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>After &lt;Script&gt; tag<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t&lt;!-- This can live in both.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t\u2026.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t--&gt; so that JS skips.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;\/script&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<pre class='indent-c'><code class='block'>&lt;meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\"&gt;<\/code><\/pre>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>\"IE=edge\".<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>\"IE=9\".<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>\"IE=EmulateIE9.<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>\"IE=8\".<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>\"IE=EmulateIE8\".<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>\"IE=7\".<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>\"IE=EmulateIE7\".<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<ul class=\"list-bullet content-list\">\n\t\t<li><div>\"IE=5\".<\/div><\/li>\n\t<\/ul>\n\t<p>\n\t\tEmulate respects specific directives ulike pures.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t________________.\n\t<\/p>\n\t<h2>Open Link in New Tab|Window<\/h2>\n\t<p>\n\t\tTarget=\"_blank\".\n\t<\/p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t*Same \u2018Target\u2019